{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971300/extras/15bd786cfdce0ed60461c3f2bfe01a78.avif?t=1771925223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971300/extras_big/15bd786cfdce0ed60461c3f2bfe01a78.webp?t=1771925223 width=1560 height=293 /></span>Explore a surreal world shaped by memory, color, and the fragments of a girl\u2019s imagination.<br><i>iNERTiA</i> is an indie RPG about dissociation, recovery, and the friends (imaginary or not) who help us survive. Guide Juno through her new life in Indigo Creek, build bonds that feel real, and uncover the facets of her psyche one by one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven RPG mixing emotional narrative, exploration and turn-based battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every single choice matters. Even the ones that look like they don't....</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn animation and pixel art places that... Change with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological exploration of trauma, memory, and identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic characters with questionable humor and even more questionable lifestyles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Themes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the games that came before it, <i>iNERTiA</i> tells a deeply personal story about letting go, rediscovering color, and learning that healing is never easy or linear... but it's always worth it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971300?t=1771925223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971300/15a03674e6f3ebfd2f29f6058386edd9b835feec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771925223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste